    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: 'That is the whole control scheme.


    Two action buttons maximum is
    a hard rule,

    and Red Light needs neither of them.


    Move on GO.  Freeze
    on STOP.

    Barnaby is biased, and he lies.'
